id: pm-noq46i
title: "GH-851: canonicalize init discovery tracker roots on macOS"
description: Nightly macOS Node 24 exposes a /var versus /private/var assertion drift in init discovery provenance. Canonicalize the test expectation to the filesystem identity returned by runInit without weakening current-versus-ancestor discovery coverage.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: github,macos,nightly,path-canonicalization
created_at: "2026-08-01T07:55:14.379Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-01T07:59:21.074Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-01T07:59:05.253Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-01T07:59:05.253Z"
author: "harness:codex"
resolution: fixed
expected_result: Current and ancestor init discovery paths compare equal across macOS symlink aliases while preserving discovery provenance.
actual_result: "Nightly macOS returned canonical /private/var tracker roots while the test expected the lexical /var alias, producing one false assertion failure."
